{"book":"decimals","bookTitle":"Decimals","concept":5,"title":"Adding and subtracting","grades":"Grades 5–7","goal":"I can add and subtract decimals.","teach":"Line up the <b>decimal commas</b> so tenths are under tenths and hundredths under hundredths. Fill empty places with zeros, then add or subtract as with whole numbers. Put the comma in the answer under the other commas.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:174px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 134 92\"><text x=\"41.0\" y=\"20.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">4</text><text x=\"67.0\" y=\"20.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">,</text><text x=\"93.0\" y=\"20.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">7</text><text x=\"119.0\" y=\"20.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">0</text><text x=\"41.0\" y=\"46.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">2</text><text x=\"67.0\" y=\"46.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">,</text><text x=\"93.0\" y=\"46.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">8</text><text x=\"119.0\" y=\"46.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><text x=\"15.0\" y=\"46.7\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">+</text><line x1=\"17.6\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"56\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"41.0\" y=\"75.5\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">7</text><text x=\"67.0\" y=\"75.5\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">,</text><text x=\"93.0\" y=\"75.5\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><text x=\"119.0\" y=\"75.5\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">5</text><line x1=\"17.6\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></svg></span></div>","ex":{"q":"Calculate 12,4 − 3,75.","steps":["Write 12,4 as 12,40 so both have 2 decimal places.","Line up the commas and subtract: 12,40 − 3,75.","= 8,65."]},"watch":"Line up the commas, not the last digits: 3,4 + 1,25 = 4,65.","qs":[{"text":"Calculate 12,4 − 3,75.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"8.65","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"12,40 − 3,75","steps":"1. Rule: to add or subtract decimals, line up the commas (fill gaps with zeros), then work as with whole numbers.<br>2. 12,40 − 3,75<br>3. = 8,65"},{"text":"Calculate 0,8 + 0,45 + 1,2.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"2.45","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Line up the commas.","steps":"1. Rule: to add or subtract decimals, line up the commas (fill gaps with zeros), then work as with whole numbers.<br>2. 0,80 + 0,45 + 1,20<br>3. = 2,45"},{"text":"Calculate 10 − 3,62.","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Answer","a":"6.38","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"10,00 − 3,62","steps":"1. Rule: to add or subtract decimals, line up the commas (fill gaps with zeros), then work as with whole numbers.<br>2. 10,00 − 3,62<br>3. = 6,38"}]}